  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When Shi Zong and Golden Fur Immortal Monarch say Fang Yuan wants Chai clan’s nurtured humans killed to complete Human Sea, one female immortal, Chai Ke Qing, shouts furiously that the demon deserves death for disregarding lives so casually.",
      "chapters": [
        2137
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_zong",
        "char_golden_fur_immortal_monarch",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_chai_clan",
        "loc_human_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She shouts in anger that Fang Yuan deserves death when the envoys’ terms excavate Chai clan’s core foundation. When Bing Yuan offers rank eight Immortal Gu, including one said to raise Chai clan’s Immortal Gu House to rank eight, she yells that fellow supreme elders must not be deceived by the demon Fang Yuan and these variant human Gu Immortals. Even if the Immortal Gu are real, Chai clan belongs to the grand righteous path and must not lose identity and honor for benefits or collude with demons. If Ancestor Chai Fu were still alive, he would definitely berate them furiously.",
      "chapters": [
        2138
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "righteous-path-protest",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bing_yuan",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_chai_fu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has undergone immortal ascension just recently and had done so through relationships. Although she has talent, she has always been taken care of by Gu Immortal seniors and is not aware of how the world worked. Her understanding of the Gu Immortal world is even less than Shang Xin Ci. She refuses to believe Wu Yong has traded with Fang Yuan’s side and urges the clan not to listen. Only she keeps speaking after the clan inclines toward cooperation. Chai Gan seals her so she cannot budge, and her ancestor Chai Dui Shan strengthens the seal. Her eyes redden as she looks at that ancestor. Narration later states that when headquarters were thinly guarded and an earth path immemorial desolate beast attacked, the Gu Immortals left behind, with Chai Ke Qing as the head, used killer moves without caring for losses. The beast was killed, but Human Smoke Mountain was heavily damaged and almost turned into a crater.",
      "chapters": [
        2139
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "seal-and-mountain-defense",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_xin_ci",
        "char_wu_yong",
        "char_chai_gan",
        "loc_human_smoke_mountain"
      ]
    }
  ],
